---
import PageLayout from "~/layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---

<PageLayout title="Privacy notice | Dwellfield" description="How Dwellfield handles information submitted through the website enquiry form.">
  <section class="bg-bone px-6 py-20 lg:px-10 lg:py-28">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[900px]">
      <p class="eyebrow mb-7 text-brass-2">Dwellfield / Your information</p>
      <h1 class="font-display text-[clamp(4rem,8vw,7rem)] leading-[.9] tracking-[-.035em]">Privacy<br /><em>notice.</em></h1>
      <p class="mt-8 text-sm text-ink-3">Last updated 14 November 2026</p>
      <div class="mt-12 space-y-10 border-t border-line pt-10 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-2">
        <section><h2 class="font-display text-3xl text-ink">What we collect</h2><p class="mt-3">When you use the enquiry form, Dwellfield collects your name, email address, suburb or postcode, intended use for the home and any optional message you provide. Please do not send payment details or sensitive personal information through this form.</p></section>
        <section><h2 class="font-display text-3xl text-ink">Why we collect it</h2><p class="mt-3">We use this information to respond to your enquiry, discuss the site review process and prepare relevant product or quotation information. Submitting the form does not add you to a marketing mailing list.</p></section>
        <section><h2 class="font-display text-3xl text-ink">Where it goes</h2><p class="mt-3">Enquiries are processed and stored through Netlify Forms. Authorised people handling Dwellfield enquiries may access them. Netlify may process data outside Australia. We may ask your permission before sharing detailed site information with an external project professional.</p></section>
        <section><h2 class="font-display text-3xl text-ink">Keeping and correcting information</h2><p class="mt-3">We keep enquiry information for as long as needed to respond and manage the enquiry, then review it for deletion. You can request access, correction or deletion by using the <a href="/#enquire" class="underline underline-offset-4">enquiry form</a> and writing “Privacy request” in the message.</p></section>
        <section><h2 class="font-display text-3xl text-ink">Questions</h2><p class="mt-3">For questions about this notice or your information, contact Dwellfield through the <a href="/#enquire" class="underline underline-offset-4">enquiry form</a>. We will update this notice if our operating entity, contact details or data handling changes.</p></section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
